Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.48,0:00:03.86,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hmm? Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:07.49,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,All these houseplants \Njust look the same to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.49,0:00:09.95,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What? Surely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.95,0:00:12.37,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Cactus... I want a cactus!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.37,0:00:15.07,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Why are you complaining?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.07,0:00:19.16,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You're the one who wanted some greenery \Nin the classroom for summer, Nene.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.16,0:00:21.32,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Whistle, whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:22.63,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Say, Yamabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:24.80,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What's this one called?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:27.28,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's a {\i1}Ficus benghalensis{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:29.97,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Native to India's Bengal region, \Nit's also known as a banyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.97,0:00:31.76,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's known for being long-living.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:35.25,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's resilient and easy to raise, \Nso it's perfect for beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:36.97,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But beware of the sap.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:36.97,Main - Top,NENE,0,0,0,,Gross! He's a plant otaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:42.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It causes allergic reactions, \Nso wear gloves when handling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.97,0:00:37.89,Main - Top,IKO,0,0,0,,Cactus...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.27,0:00:41.86,Main - Top,IKO,0,0,0,,Cactus... Cactus... Cactus...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.86,0:00:42.61,Main - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.61,0:00:44.38,Main - Top,IKO,0,0,0,,Cactus!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.61,0:00:44.38,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,This one's pretty cute, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.47,0:00:46.78,Main - Top,IKO,0,0,0,,Cactus...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.47,0:00:47.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's a pachira.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.49,0:00:52.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's known for its five-leaf stems \Nand its rapid growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.21,0:00:51.62,Main - Top,IKO,0,0,0,,Cactus... Cactus...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.46,0:00:53.41,Main - Top,IKO,0,0,0,,Cactus...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.46,0:00:57.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,During spring and summer in particular, \Nit'll grow a lot while you look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.92,0:00:57.20,Main - Top,IKO,0,0,0,,Cactus! Cactus!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.71,0:00:58.95,Main - Top,IKO,0,0,0,,Cactus...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:04.63,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We came to this faraway store \Njust to buy this one plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.63,0:01:08.99,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We picked it because \Nthe five leaves represent us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:11.04,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,More like because it was cheap, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:13.14,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I wanted a cactus...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.14,0:01:14.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Sure is hot, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.86,0:01:17.12,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Summer's almost here, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.12,0:01:19.89,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Ugh, I don't want to get sunburned.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.87,0:01:27.78,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I enjoyed the mini-concert the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.78,0:01:30.99,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I really do love singing my own songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.99,0:01:35.18,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I want to pull off a street \Nperformance the same way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.18,0:01:37.33,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,but I'm too scared to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.33,0:01:38.37,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Heck...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.37,0:01:41.00,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I still haven't managed to write a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:44.37,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What do I do? Summer break's almost here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.69,0:01:49.14,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rikka still hasn't brought me a new song.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.14,0:01:51.59,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Her trauma is deeper than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.14,0:01:56.89,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I should probably explore other options. \NWhat can yours truly do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.85,0:02:01.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Pretty much anything, that's what!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.71,0:02:03.16,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:06.88,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.88,0:02:09.48,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Someone's doing a street performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:11.88,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I've never heard this song before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:15.02,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Sorry, go on without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.02,0:02:15.78,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:18.35,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What's going on, Rikka-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:19.57,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Bathroom break?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:21.75,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I-I'm gonna be this tree's mommy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.18,0:02:25.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I've heard that hypnosis \Ncan help one overcome trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.86,0:02:27.50,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll ask my big sis to coach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.17,0:02:38.14,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It really is Aiko. I could tell \Nby the way she played.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.51,0:02:41.78,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,So she's still doing this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.40,0:02:44.68,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I can't be seen because it'd be awkward,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:46.66,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,but I want to stay and listen some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.59,0:02:51.48,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.91,0:02:53.75,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,The next song will be my last.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.75,0:02:55.24,Main,UNC,0,0,0,,Say, missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.24,0:02:57.75,Main,UNC,0,0,0,,Nobody's even listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.75,0:03:00.32,Main,UNC,0,0,0,,What's the point in continuing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.32,0:03:01.37,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Uh-oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:05.65,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,Shut your trap, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.65,0:03:07.92,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,I'm doing this because I want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:11.51,Main,UNC,0,0,0,,Say what? \NYou're shit at this, so just quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.51,0:03:13.90,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,Well, you've got shit for ears, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.90,0:03:16.72,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna put up with \Nanyone who insults my music!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:19.08,Main,UNC,0,0,0,,You're never gonna make it anywhere! Pah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.08,0:03:20.22,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,Shut it, fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.22,0:03:22.53,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,Never show me your face again, \Nyou old fart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:26.64,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,Anyway, here's my last song.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:29.89,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,I didn't write this song by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.89,0:03:32.64,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,I wrote it with a friend of mine \Na long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:36.59,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,We did music together \Nback in middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:38.94,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,We were so excited \Nwhen we finished the song,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:42.27,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,thinking we made a masterpiece, \Nand we sent it to a record label.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.27,0:03:44.13,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,We actually got a response, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:47.75,Flashback,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,Which one of you sang the chorus?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.75,0:03:49.81,Flashback,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,We only need the girl with that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:52.85,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,But I was still happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.85,0:03:56.29,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,because our music had been acknowledged.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.29,0:03:59.78,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,That's why I entrusted \Neverything to my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.78,0:04:02.05,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,I told her she'd better make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:05.30,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,She'd better become the number one \Nartist in Japan with our music!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.53,0:04:09.23,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,But what did that idiot do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.23,0:04:12.92,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,She had a setback or two \Nand ran away from the record label!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.92,0:04:17.16,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,Quit chickening out and running \Nto covers of idol songs, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:21.20,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,What kind of middle-schooler brat \Ngives up after one failure?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.69,0:04:27.75,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,So I have to keep singing this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.15,0:04:30.50,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,After all, her talent is the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:34.01,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,Even if she wasn't \NJapan's number one artist,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.01,0:04:37.21,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,she could still be number one \Nin someone's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.54,0:04:41.27,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,So it's fine as long \Nas somebody understands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.27,0:04:44.97,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,If you come to like this song, \Nplease remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:46.43,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,"The Calm of Night."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:06.69,Broadcast - Top,AIKO,0,0,0,,As the sun sank into the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.69,0:05:10.07,Broadcast - Top,AIKO,0,0,0,,We let out a deep sigh
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:12.91,Broadcast - Top,AIKO,0,0,0,,And the oceans responded to us
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:15.69,Broadcast - Top,AIKO,0,0,0,,With a big white wave
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.66,0:05:20.36,Broadcast - Top,AIKO,0,0,0,,And dragged the wind away with it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.76,0:05:27.35,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Keep watching this 5-yen coin, \Nand what do you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.35,0:05:30.79,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You'll find that even a lemon \Ncan taste sweet like sugar
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:33.48,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Ooh, I'm starting to believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:35.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Okay, go ahead and eat that lemon slice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:39.69,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Sour!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.69,0:05:42.88,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Breathe in... breathe out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:45.07,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,My tongue...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.07,0:05:46.98,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It didn't work at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.98,0:05:50.42,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I was hoping to remove \NRikka's trauma this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.28,0:05:54.18,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Rikka's starting her mini-concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.17,0:05:57.29,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,It's been a while since her last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:58.82,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.82,0:06:01.01,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming \Neven though it's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.85,0:06:05.65,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Let's get right to it. \NHere's the first song.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.65,0:06:07.26,Main,F. STUDENT A,0,0,0,,Wait, what's the title?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:10.26,Main,F. STUDENT B,0,0,0,,Wonder what she's gonna perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:28.75,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,As the sun sank into the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.35,0:06:28.75,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What is that song?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.75,0:06:31.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wait, is it an original?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.75,0:06:32.35,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We let out a deep sigh
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.35,0:06:35.00,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And the oceans responded to us
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.99,0:06:35.58,Main,F. STUDENT C,0,0,0,,What is this song?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:38.66,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,With a big white wave
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.98,0:06:38.66,Main,F. STUDENT D,0,0,0,,Aw, I wanted the usual stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.66,0:06:45.09,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And dragged the wind away with it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:41.33,Main,F. STUDENT E,0,0,0,,This doesn't feel like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:46.35,Main,F. STUDENT F,0,0,0,,I don't know, I think I like this better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.09,0:06:48.49,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,After we saw it off
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.49,0:06:52.60,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We made a promise for no reason
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.60,0:06:53.76,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.10,0:06:58.54,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The calm takes over the night
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:07:02.23,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,When the calm takes over the night
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:08.49,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We feel like there's nobody else \Nin the world but us
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:11.73,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The sea blends into the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.73,0:07:15.55,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,When the sea quietly blends into the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.55,0:07:20.39,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I know it's just the two of us
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.39,0:07:24.68,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,But I still whisper to you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.68,0:07:28.26,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,When did she write a song like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.19,0:07:33.17,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Ah, in the calm of night
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.26,0:07:31.31,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's more, she did it all on her own, \Nwithout yours truly's help?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:36.64,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rikka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:39.65,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,When did you write that original song?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.65,0:07:41.23,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.23,0:07:43.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It seems I've underestimated you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:47.03,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You've grown a lot when I wasn't looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:48.87,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:51.33,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You haven't given me \Nenough attention lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.47,0:07:54.34,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:57.31,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,For this song, I stopped caring \Nabout appealing to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.31,0:07:59.54,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I wrote it for someone special to me—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.54,0:08:01.67,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,my best friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:04.77,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,and one more throw-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.06,0:08:10.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm a throw-in, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:13.96,Main,SIGN A,0,0,0,,{\an8}WHILE YOU LOOK AWAY
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.74,0:09:47.07,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We have a date and time \Nfor the street performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.07,0:09:50.14,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I've secured a venue, too. \NNow we just need your songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.14,0:09:54.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Now, rock my inner ear \Nwith the power of your new songs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:56.03,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.33,0:09:58.84,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Rikka's working on a song right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:09:59.59,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:02.41,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,And Bucky, your regular voice \Nis already loud enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.41,0:10:04.56,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you were done?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.56,0:10:06.78,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,There's still one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.78,0:10:10.55,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm planning to put five songs on the CD \NI'm selling at the performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.85,0:10:13.82,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,But I just can't finish the last song.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:18.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Considering how you couldn't write \Nat all before, this is good progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:19.97,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.45,0:10:24.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't throw \Nmy praise out the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:27.38,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Rikka ain't an easy lass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.38,0:10:30.60,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Oh, I finished the draft for my CD cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:31.99,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Show us! Show us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:34.13,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:35.95,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Do you hate rabbits?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:38.67,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That's a peace sign, not a rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.67,0:10:40.24,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,So, what does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:41.46,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.70,0:10:45.16,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,This is a symbol for defiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:48.53,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'll make sure it spreads \Nto all corners of Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.53,0:10:49.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.46,0:10:52.74,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Wow. Now even I'm starting to get nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.74,0:10:54.86,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We'll all come watch your show, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:57.03,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Oh, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.33,0:10:58.74,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,For this show,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.74,0:11:01.31,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'd like to do it without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.31,0:11:02.10,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:07.37,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Having you there would make me \Nhappy and help me relax,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:10.90,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,but if I got too used to that, \Nthere'd be no point to this show.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:12.44,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:15.34,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That's a shame, but I guess \Nit's for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:17.02,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Okay, gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:19.12,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,But we'll be at the next show, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.25,0:11:21.37,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:24.57,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,How'd you suddenly make progress \Nafter being stuck for so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.57,0:11:27.12,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Did you find a song-writing trick\N or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:29.38,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Trick? Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.38,0:11:33.27,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,All this time, I'd been trying to write \Nsongs that'd appeal to lots of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:36.91,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Songs I wouldn't be ashamed of, \Nsongs that would actually sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.91,0:11:40.35,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That's what I was trying to do, \Nbut it just didn't go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.35,0:11:45.27,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,When I tried writing them while picturing \Nthe person I'm dedicating them to,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:48.12,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,the lyrics and melodies \Ncame naturally to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:52.86,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I wasn't making \Nmusic to send some kind of message.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:57.74,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I was making music because I wanted \Nthis person to listen to my songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.74,0:12:02.38,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,But my pen stopped moving \Nwhile writing this last song.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:03.56,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:07.14,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,If I want to say something,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:11.02,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,maybe I should tell them directly \Ninstead of using my music.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.85,0:12:15.65,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I see. She's reached an impasse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.65,0:12:21.54,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,As a producer, I should resolve this \Nand have her write the best song ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.00,0:12:23.00,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.49,0:12:25.77,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is there anything I can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:29.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I can get you anything you desire, \Nbe it a place, a situation, or people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.49,0:12:31.75,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Ugh, you sound like a scrub \Nwho got rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:33.21,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Anything? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:35.88,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Of course! For yours truly, \Nimpossible is nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.20,0:12:37.24,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:47.04,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.37,0:12:49.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I did say I could get you anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.96,0:12:53.65,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But why ask to chat with me \Nby the beach at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.65,0:12:58.11,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I used to write songs \Nat midnight just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.11,0:13:00.26,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I thought being here might help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.03,0:13:02.78,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Have a little chat with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.12,0:13:05.49,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Come sit next to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:19.46,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,About what you said earlier today...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:24.26,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,"Making music for just one person." \NThat's a good way to go about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.26,0:13:29.34,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,For example, Beethoven supposedly \Ndedicated "Für Elise" to someone he loved,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:31.39,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,and it's still beloved \N200 years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.93,0:13:35.31,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It's amazing that you discovered \Nthis method all on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.31,0:13:37.35,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Great job, Rikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:38.92,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.88,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Who are you dedicating those songs to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.88,0:13:43.95,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm too embarrassed to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:48.57,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Let's just say it's someone I once \Ndistanced myself from out of awkwardness,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:52.75,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,and now I need to work up the courage \Nto tell them how I feel, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:54.12,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:56.73,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She must be talking about \Nher friend, that Aiko girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:13:59.75,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,They did have a falling out \Nover musical styles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.06,0:14:00.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:05.05,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What are you trying to tell \Nthis person through your music?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:07.29,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You want me to tell you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.29,0:14:08.97,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I won't know unless you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.91,0:14:13.14,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,"I love you."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:21.29,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's rather direct, but she wants \Nto convey her love for her friend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:24.29,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Are you feeling unwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.29,0:14:25.55,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.55,0:14:28.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey, Rikka. \NCan I take a look at your lyrics?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.46,0:14:29.32,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.32,0:14:30.48,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Or I won't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:31.72,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:33.98,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,How's getting embarrassed going to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:38.63,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.63,0:14:39.55,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:42.13,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:44.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hmm, are you being evasive on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.53,0:14:49.75,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,These lyrics are pretty abstract \Nand avoid expressing anything directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.75,0:14:53.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,They won't get the message. \NWhat exactly do you love about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.93,0:14:54.85,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.85,0:14:57.27,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.27,0:15:01.90,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Well, uh... they were a good listener \Nto me late at night...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.90,0:15:05.06,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,and encouraged me to pursue my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.06,0:15:09.35,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I really enjoyed talking to them, \Nand they gave me hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:12.06,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What else? Give me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.06,0:15:13.50,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Urk...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:15.42,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Th-They're kind...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.42,0:15:16.42,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yes, and?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.42,0:15:18.20,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,They have a pleasant voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:19.65,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.93,0:15:22.46,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,But the biggest thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.46,0:15:26.49,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,is that they waited for me all this time \Nafter I ran away from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.49,0:15:28.75,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What a thoughtful person!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.75,0:15:30.83,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,See? You've got all these things to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:32.85,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why not use your lyrics to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.85,0:15:38.56,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It feels like cheating to use music \Nto express what I couldn't say directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:43.27,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,If I express my feelings that way, \Nit might disappoint them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.30,0:15:49.82,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I feel like they'd want to hear what \Nthey really want to hear directly from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:50.66,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.66,0:15:51.45,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.45,0:15:52.64,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:54.09,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Little Miss Want-It-All!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.09,0:15:54.70,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.70,0:15:56.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You are blessed with a gift!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.53,0:15:59.54,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You can express yourself \Nin a way most people can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:00.79,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's there to debate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:02.72,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,There's no hierarchy in self-expression!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:06.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's not the method—it's the strength \Nof feeling that moves the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:10.92,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Not using a gift you have goes against \Nthe Yamabukis' way of life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:14.64,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm an Inohana, though? Let's say...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.64,0:16:17.93,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Let's say someone used a song \Nto express their feelings to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:19.32,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Would you be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.99,0:16:22.02,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:23.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:28.35,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.28,0:16:34.27,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Then I guess I'll leave \Nthis song off the CD.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:38.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What? I thought I just \Ngot rid of your worries!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.38,0:16:44.54,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It's because this last song is meant \Nto express something very dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.86,0:16:47.88,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Once I can call myself an artist—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:52.21,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,once I feel I have the right to use \Nmusic as a means of expression—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:54.68,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,only then will I release it to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:57.87,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Are you going to save it \Nfor a Budokan concert?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:16:59.75,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Nothing that grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.21,0:17:03.56,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,If this street performance goes well
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.56,0:17:06.65,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,and I manage to sell 50 copies of my CD,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.44,0:17:09.78,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:15.93,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'll sing it to the person dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.30,0:17:22.13,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm performing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.13,0:17:25.79,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Indeed. This park is known as \Na mecca for street performances.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.79,0:17:29.50,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Celestial, the latest-and-hottest \Nband right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.50,0:17:32.63,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,performed here \Nuntil last year too, I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.63,0:17:36.00,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,So the audience will have \Npretty high standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:40.14,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But if you can pick up fans here, \Nyou'll surely make a name for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:45.15,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I made fliers and distributed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:48.59,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You need to make a good first \Nimpression to win the audience over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.59,0:17:52.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I secured you a spot with \Nplenty of space and visibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:55.84,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm getting a sharp pain in my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:18:01.11,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,This brings back memories. \NI was nervous the first time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.11,0:18:02.02,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.02,0:18:04.31,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It's a different kind of pain now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.31,0:18:08.10,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Back then, I knew nothing \Nand was full of wide-eyed hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.10,0:18:10.17,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,but now I'm just scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:13.55,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Scared they'll look at me \Nwith those eyes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.55,0:18:14.63,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:16.37,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I probably can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.37,0:18:19.41,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Maybe I should just call it off, \Nor something...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.41,0:18:20.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.85,0:18:21.93,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.93,0:18:24.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Do you find my eyes scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:25.66,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,N-Not really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.66,0:18:27.02,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Right? Aren't they lovely?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.02,0:18:28.77,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Don't put words in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.26,0:18:31.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Listen, Rikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.49,0:18:35.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If you're having a hard time during \Nthe show and can't keep your head up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:37.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,just look into my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:39.13,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.13,0:18:40.21,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.21,0:18:42.44,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's a good thing I came prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.37,0:18:46.54,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Even if you lose sight of me \Namong a sea of spectators,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.54,0:18:48.56,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,you'll be able to see me wave these!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:50.98,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'd die of cringe, so don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.98,0:18:54.54,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What? You'd use the word "cringe" \Nto describe yours truly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.15,0:19:00.30,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You're helping me loosen up, huh? Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.30,0:19:02.46,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'll give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.32,0:19:06.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yeah, do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.92,0:19:08.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We'll watch over you the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:16.05,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}500 YEN PER CD
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.05,0:19:17.55,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}INOHANA RIKKA
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:26.66,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Here I go with my first song, \N"Flickering Days."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:46.31,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,As we looked up the open blue sky
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.55,0:19:46.31,Main,GIRL,0,0,0,,What do you... wanna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.31,0:19:49.65,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,In bright white letters
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.65,0:19:54.05,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We wrote about our purpose, \Nwe wrote about our future
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.05,0:19:57.65,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And painted it with our dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.95,0:20:03.27,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,With each passing "See you tomorrow"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.07,0:20:02.70,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Her voice lacks its usual oomph, \Nand she's not in the right rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.70,0:20:05.57,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I suppose it's not that easy\N to get rid of her anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.27,0:20:05.87,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Our hearts grew closer
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.87,0:20:10.26,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,As we have good times and bad
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.34,0:20:11.30,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,With no audience, her \Nmental state will only worsen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.26,0:20:15.09,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We walk in awkward strides
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:15.09,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,You need to stay calm, Rikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:20.51,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We hold hands tight, \Nand our words reach each other
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:18.37,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I knew it wouldn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:20.51,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Nobody's stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.51,0:20:23.44,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And gently push us forward
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.18,0:20:24.37,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Nobody's listening to my song.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.44,0:20:26.38,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The round postbox, the usual crosswalk
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:28.25,Flashback Italics,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:28.25,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That teary face, the shining smile
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.25,0:20:30.42,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,They're all de—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.25,0:20:30.42,Flashback Italics,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,Maybe I expected too much of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:39.00,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Sorry, Aiko. I just can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:40.06,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:50.51,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,H-Huh? We got lost and wound up here...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.51,0:20:52.32,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Your acting's way too awkward!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.32,0:20:54.75,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,C-Come on! \NWe don't want to miss our train!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.11,0:21:00.59,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Imagine we're always in the front row.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.76,0:21:04.22,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Right, I'd forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.22,0:21:06.78,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Screw trying to sing for lots of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.78,0:21:09.52,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'll just sing for the people \NI want to hear my song.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:16.69,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Here's my second song, \N"ask for the moon."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:31.15,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I wrote this song for my three \Nfellow broadcasting club members.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.63,0:21:35.43,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,So they're the only people \NI need to sing for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.61,0:21:40.52,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I believe these hands, my voice
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.13,0:21:47.08,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Will get to where I want them to go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.69,0:21:57.14,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,380,000 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:22:02.15,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,From an impossible distance
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.13,0:22:02.15,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I made the right call by asking \Nfor their help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.15,0:22:06.64,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}BROADCASTING ROOM (TEMP)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.87,0:22:06.64,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You steal my heart away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:06.64,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What? She's lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.64,0:22:11.02,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And shine a light on my solitude
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.64,0:22:12.01,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yes. She said not to come because she \Ndidn't want to be overly reliant on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:15.74,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Whether it was coincidence \Nor a magic spell
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.02,0:22:13.33,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,but that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.33,0:22:16.38,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She doesn't want you to see her fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:21.31,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The clouds give way to a ray of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.38,0:22:20.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's scared that you might look at her \Nwith disappointment in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.16,0:22:23.02,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We'd never look at her \Nthat way, you dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.31,0:22:24.00,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Is it possible or impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.02,0:22:24.01,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Yeah, never!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:26.14,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Will it come true or not
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.01,0:22:25.21,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why get mad at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.21,0:22:27.55,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What can we do, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.14,0:22:29.40,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Nobody knows
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.95,0:22:31.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You don't have to watch her show up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.40,0:22:34.31,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That's why I hope, that's why I journey
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.79,0:22:33.65,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Just be there for Rikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.31,0:22:39.21,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Using my dreams as footholds
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.42,0:22:39.43,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's getting better and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.43,0:22:41.21,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Keep it up and reel them in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.85,0:22:44.96,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I know your voice can reach them, Rikka!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:49.72,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Wanting to touch the waxing \Nand waning moon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:52.05,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I reached out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.05,0:22:56.88,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Even if it was a small, \Ninsignificant step
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.88,0:22:59.55,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I traveled my universe
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.55,0:23:05.92,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Believing I'll get there someday
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.41,0:23:08.76,Main,WOMAN A,0,0,0,,That girl has a lovely voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.76,0:23:13.29,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Even if I must walk down \Na path never trodden before
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.76,0:23:10.19,Main,MAN B,0,0,0,,Want to stay and listen?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.29,0:23:17.81,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Even if I'm dreaming too big, \Nhoping for too much
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.81,0:23:22.62,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,My hand traverses \Na 60-centimeter universe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.62,0:23:30.33,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And gets closer to \Nthe bright side of the moon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.50,0:23:33.22,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Watch me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.99,0:23:36.98,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.98,0:23:38.48,Main,CREDITS SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}TRANSLATION: SRIRAM GURUNATHAN\NTIMING: MARIANA MARTINEZ\NEDITING: WILLIAM HAGGARD
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.48,0:23:39.90,Main,CREDITS SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}QUALITY CHECK: S BILYEU\NTRANSLATION CHECK: MICHELLE TYMON
